# Old WordPress URLs that have a v1 counterpart. Notes and the source of the
# slugs: docs/wordpress-redirects.md. Old URLs with no counterpart are left
# out on purpose, so they 404.
#
# Netlify uses the first rule that matches and ignores trailing slashes, so
# exact paths come before each section's catch-all. A `/section/*` rule also
# matches `/section` itself, so sections whose path is still a v1 route
# (/donate, /get-involved, /contact) list their old children one by one.

# About JCN
/about-jcn/history-mission   /about/history      301
/about-jcn/board-staff       /about/leadership   301
/about-jcn/services          /services           301
/about-jcn/*                 /about              301
/service/*                   /services           301
/staff-member/*              /about/leadership   301

